      said I could ask the Bear for help.
    journalEntryCompleted: 
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 820107480}
  - hintText: Bring Fish to the Bear (0/3)
    journalEntryActive: The Bear has asked me to bring him some fish. If I can do
      that, he said he could help me scare off the Lumberjacks. I shouldn't keep
      him waiting.
    journalEntryCompleted: 
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 1894977796}
