--- !u!114 &1190043477
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1190043475}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 87a948977d4e7bc4692bda67c6b67132, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npc: {fileID: 1339490777}
  dialogueLines:
  - Hello there! Livia is your name, I gather.
  - Have seen the poacher camp down by the river? Quite the problem we have got there...
  - Our forest is suffering dearly, which is why I need your help.
  - 'Could you poke around the camp and see if there is any information we could
    make use of? '
  - I would go there myself, but you see, I'm not that difficult to spot...
  - And before you go, please be careful around the marksmen. They are not fond of
    wildlife.
  - 'I advise you to eat and get stronger before you go there. '
  - Be safe and tell me what you find at the camp. I await you return!
--- !u!114 &1190043478
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1190043475}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e09daec98c834ab40a9c2137f63f5557, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _id:
    Value: a8e4bd10-9751-4b33-a720-be3d04c1f4e2
  questName: Exploring your surroundings
  questStages:
  - hintText: Locate the Witch Hut
    journalEntryActive: I don't like those people cutting down trees and walking
      with guns... I should visit the Witch, her hut should be around the forest
      somewhere.
    journalEntryCompleted: I found her hut on a hill. The hut has a pointy hat!
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 1906020882}
  - hintText: Talk to the Witch
    journalEntryActive: 
    journalEntryCompleted: I talked to the Witch. She told me to investigate the
      camp.
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 1190043477}
  - hintText: Go to the Poacher Camp
    journalEntryActive: I remember it being right by that river. I should go there.
    journalEntryCompleted: 
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 2099116356}
  - hintText: Snoop around the Camp
    journalEntryActive: 
    journalEntryCompleted: One of the Marksmen said something about a grandpa with
      money. Can this information help somehow?
    objective:
      underlyingValue: {fileID: 1190043480}
